      "title": "CMake: Bump the minimum Python version to 3.6.",
      "message": "CMake: Bump the minimum Python version to 3.6.\n\nMake Python 3.6 the minimum required version. Version 3.6 added support\nfor f-strings.\n",
      "author_name": "Gerald Combs",
      "author_email": "gerald@wireshark.org",
      "authored_date": "2022-06-24T10:31:09.000-07:00",
